<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Maruichi 6-mth net down 42 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Maruichi 6-mth net down 42 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    16.23	   vs	  27.81</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)	   20.54	   vs	  35.24</p>
<p>    Turnover	     215.81	   vs	 232.66</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	20.11	   vs	  34.14</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Maruichi Malaysia Steel Tube Bhd. It is involved in the manufacture and trade of steel pipes and tubes and the manufacture of cold rolled steel.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
